            "review_title": "Review at Saigon Kebab House",
            "review_text": "Dannyk Vlogtastic\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nGreat dog meat\nApr 2022 • Solo\nThe food was overcooked, overpriced and disgustingly dry. The beef was so tough and items were missing. When i gave the owner my opinion he offered me a refund then became foul and abusive using shockingly bad language then changed his mind about giving me a refund. 100% without doubt this place is the worst kebab ive ever tried here. Avoid it, there are plenty other places offering quality food without being sworn at by staff or owners. 0 out of 5 is my review. Despicable food with a disgustingly abusive owner/staff\nRead more\nWritten April 17, 2022",
