            "review_title": "Review at Saigon Kebab House",
            "review_text": "Dimps\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n2\nFelt like home!\nFeb 2020 • Family\nWe went to the Saigon kebab House in Thao Dien yesterday to have a kebab as our kids were craving for a Yufka. We were surprised at how good the meat tasted. The Dönner box was the highlight of our evening with layers of cheese, fries, meat and sauce!!!! The typical Turkish chai felt like home as we all loved it served in the typical chai glasses. Service was Brilliant! Thanks guys and keep up the great work! We will be back soon. \n\nImprovement: The bread could be a little more crispy and warm.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 23, 2020",
